WHAT YOU MAY DO

  You may use this game, copy it, share it, change it, and build your own
  things from it — for fun, for school, for a project of your own, or for a
  game or asset on Roblox or any other platform — as long as you give credit
  to thankdapro. A line such as

      "Based on Island Flight Simulator by thankdapro"

  somewhere people can see it (your credits, your README, your game's page)
  is enough. Keep this licence file with any copy of the code you pass on.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

  You may not claim you made it, or remove the credit to thankdapro.

  You may not use the name "thankdapro" to suggest that thankdapro made,
  approved or is connected to your version.

THIRD-PARTY CODE

  three.js (src/vendor/three.module.js) is not ours. It is by Ricardo Cabello
  (mrdoob) and the three.js contributors under the MIT licence; its full text
  is in src/vendor/three.LICENSE and it stays under that licence.

SCP FOUNDATION CONTENT

  The game has some: the SCP Foundation's Site-91 North on the Nunatak Reach
  map, its signs and the three-arrows mark on them, the Class-D transfer
  mission and the Last Flight Out mission (src/features/scp-site.js,
  src/game/extra/scp.js, src/features/scp-escape.js, src/game/extra/scp-escape.js,
  and the map and outfit entries that go with them — each is marked with this credit:
  "SCP Foundation content by the SCP Wiki community, CC BY-SA 3.0,
  scpwiki.com"). Anything in the game that is based on the SCP Foundation —
  the names, the articles, the logo, anything taken or adapted from the SCP
  Wiki (scpwiki.com) — is the work of the SCP Wiki community and is licensed
  under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-SA 3.0), not under
  this licence. If you copy or change that part
  of the game, the CC BY-SA 3.0 terms apply to it: credit the SCP Wiki and its
  authors, and share your version of that content under the same licence.
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

NO WARRANTY

  The game is provided as it is, with no warranty of any kind. If it breaks
  something, that is on you; thankdapro is not liable for anything that comes
  from using it.

CREDITS AND PARODY

  Inspired by PTFS (Pilot Training Flight Simulator) and the Google Earth
  flight simulator. All airlines in the game are parody and not affiliated
  with any real company.
